    "observations": [
      "Control constructor 0x14821d0 calls 0x14885b0 at 0x14827c4. That helper looks up Cursor and P_BtnFocusKey first, then C_Cursor and B_Hit fallbacks, and stores the selected pane pointers at control offsets +0x68/+0x70. B_Hit is used on a fallback branch.",
      "Touch processor 0x14b94c0 calls recursive tree helper 0x14b8850 at 0x14b958c; the returned node pointer is stored at pointer-record offset +0x38 at 0x14b9594.",
      "Tree helper 0x14b8850 calls 0x14b7820 for node geometry and descends through child/sibling links at offsets +0x8/+0x18. The processor then routes the stored target through 0x14b8950 and the existing traversal path 0x14b7a10.",
      "Geometry helper 0x14b7820 reads two four-float rectangle records from node offsets +0x30..+0x3c and +0x40..+0x4c. If the secondary rectangle-associated pointer at +0x28 is non-null, it selects the overlapping bounds before testing the sampled point against the resulting rectangle. Raw instruction sequence at 0x14b78bc..0x14b7a00 contains the float-bound selection and point comparisons."
    ],
    "limit": "No recovered def-use or call edge connects control field +0x68 (the B_Hit fallback pointer) to the node rectangle fields consumed by 0x14b7820. The second rectangle is not assigned clip semantics; coordinate space, overlap precedence, BND1 instance ownership, and GPU clip use remain unresolved."
